{"3734930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demonborg Mining Co", "steam_appid": 3734930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/2f2b6f68211a43279403f5f74bad6353.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.poster.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.webm?t=1776214581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.mp4?t=1776214581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Demonborg Mining Co it's your job to pilot a drill drone through the insides of giant demon cyborgs while mining precious metals! Install and upgrade auto-firing turrets to protect you from defense bots and help you mine your way through the ever changing Demonborgs. Install dozens of perks and engage with text based events for rewards and punishments. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs. No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/5a4f11a52f3cd4874ab688ce77a1e5cd.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must make quick decisions as your drill drone perpetually descends through the procedually generated Demonborgs. Mine bricks for materials, destroy Demonborg defense bots for much needed copper, and investigate points of interest   that may help you succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the depths of procedurally generated Demonborgs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive environmental hazards and evolving enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine common and rare bricks for valuable materials and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy Demonborg defense bots for much needed copper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/44030428c15acaefaedf2144a4c465f1.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mined brick materials and copper from defeated Demonborg defense bots to upgrade your auto-firing turrets. Equip gameplay changing perks for an edge in-game and in text events. Build new turrets and maintain your drill drone between missions. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert hard-earned scrap into enhancements for your hull, auto-firing turrets, and aux bot companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip tons of perks and turrets for an edge in gameplay and text encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new equipment and maintain your drill drone between missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain permanent unlock tokens between runs and make the choice for quick rewards or permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through increasing security levels, adding new enemies, new permanent unlocks, and new hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/07b4259bdd9faba14450c6e40eca1021.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate points of interest to engage in encounters that may unlock new perks, turrets, grant you bonus materials and more. Succeed in events you would have failed using installed perks and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate Points of Interest to engage in boon or bust encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in events you would have failed using installed perks and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save a fellow drone pilot, gamble with a shady parts dealer, etc in random text event encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/2f2b6f68211a43279403f5f74bad6353.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.poster.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.webm?t=1776214581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/7945c6760dbc7cc5462692d8792f9b53.mp4?t=1776214581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Demonborg Mining Co it's your job to pilot a drill drone through the insides of giant demon cyborgs while mining precious metals! Install and upgrade auto-firing turrets to protect you from defense bots and help you mine your way through the ever changing Demonborgs. Install dozens of perks and engage with text based events for rewards and punishments. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs. No run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/5a4f11a52f3cd4874ab688ce77a1e5cd.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must make quick decisions as your drill drone perpetually descends through the procedually generated Demonborgs. Mine bricks for materials, destroy Demonborg defense bots for much needed copper, and investigate points of interest   that may help you succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the depths of procedurally generated Demonborgs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive environmental hazards and evolving enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine common and rare bricks for valuable materials and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy Demonborg defense bots for much needed copper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/44030428c15acaefaedf2144a4c465f1.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mined brick materials and copper from defeated Demonborg defense bots to upgrade your auto-firing turrets. Equip gameplay changing perks for an edge in-game and in text events. Build new turrets and maintain your drill drone between missions. Unlock permanent upgrades between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert hard-earned scrap into enhancements for your hull, auto-firing turrets, and aux bot companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip tons of perks and turrets for an edge in gameplay and text encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new equipment and maintain your drill drone between missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain permanent unlock tokens between runs and make the choice for quick rewards or permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through increasing security levels, adding new enemies, new permanent unlocks, and new hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/extras/07b4259bdd9faba14450c6e40eca1021.avif?t=1776214581\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate points of interest to engage in encounters that may unlock new perks, turrets, grant you bonus materials and more. Succeed in events you would have failed using installed perks and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate Points of Interest to engage in boon or bust encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in events you would have failed using installed perks and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save a fellow drone pilot, gamble with a shady parts dealer, etc in random text event encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Demonborg Mining Co is a unique rogue-lite about mining the insides of giant demon cyborgs with your auto-firing turret loaded drill drone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/37458889e58da7a00a1b46e89d7298a6efd1c1c8/header.jpg?t=1776214581", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734930/36b6c01126d05942698b0688ba4c3724c4e03652/capsule_2